```typescript
const getPage: GetPageFunction = <T extends PageIds>(...args: Args<T>) => {
  return getPagePath(locale, ...args); 
}

const getPagePath: GetPagePathFunction = <T extends PageIds>(
  locale: Locale, 
  ...args: Args<T>  
) => {
  \/\/ implementation
}
```

The key things:

- Args<T> returns a tuple type 
- Use rest parameters `...args` to unpack the tuple when passing to getPagePath

This allows the tuples to be unpacked properly without errors.

